mary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Netty 4+\n\nFrom [RFC6455](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc6455#section-4.1):\n\n> If the status code received from the server is not 101, the\n>        client handles the response per HTTP [RFC2616] procedures.  In\n>        particular, the client might perform authentication if it\n>        receives a 401 status code; the server might redirect the client\n>        using a 3xx status code (but clients are not required to follow\n>        them), etc.  Otherwise, proceed as follows.\n\nBut WebSocketClientHandshakerXX verify crashes with `WebSocketHandshakeException` when [status isn't 101](https://github.com/netty/netty/blob/netty-4.1.0.Beta8/codec-http/src/main/java/io/netty/handler/codec/http/websocketx/WebSocketClientHandshaker13.java#L215-L217).\n\nThis makes WebSocketClientHandshaker unable to deal with standard HTTP mechanisms such as redirect and non-preemptive authentication.\n\nPS: I'm trying to upgrade AHC to Netty 4.1.\nThe migration path from 4.0 is very hard, possibly because of a bad AHC design. But still.\nSo far, I've been dealing with handshake and pipeline upgrade manually (meaning that AHC does support redirect and auth during WebSocket handshake).\nBut now:\n- I can't migrate to `WebSocketClientHandshaker` because of this bug\n- I can't figure out how to use `HttpClientUpgradeHandler`, I don't see it used anywhere in the WebSocket examples, nor in the `websocketx` package\n- In order to upgrade the pipeline manually, I have to do a very ugly hack: `HttpClientCodec` no longer exists in the pipeline, and `Decoder` and `Encoder` classes are private, so I can't look up by class and have to look up by name, such as `HttpClientCodec$Decoder#0`\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/4528/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/4528/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}